/-! # Staged checks of `examples/dyn/pinned/hello-gcc`

Every theorem is one leaf (`Silmaril.Elf.Staged.Leaf`) proved by `elf_leaf` (generated by `elf-staged emit-example` from examples/dyn/pinned/hello-gcc, 15960 bytes): natively on
the file's `ByteArray` when the trust policy allows the leaf's procedure in this module, and
otherwise by the kernel on the same file's kernel bytes `hello`. The propositions are the same
in every profile; `Silmaril.Elf.Staged.Example.Profiles` checks them under `local` and
`paranoid`. -/

@[expose] public section

